1
00:00:20,816 --> 00:00:22,672
(Silence; Operating Room Area)

2
00:00:39,860 --> 00:00:43,424
=Stand Up for Love=

3
00:00:43,720 --> 00:00:46,656
=Episode 6=

4
00:00:59,280 --> 00:00:59,799
Jiang Lai.

5
00:01:00,840 --> 00:01:01,840
Did Zhang Haotian

6
00:01:02,240 --> 00:01:03,759
hurt you?

7
00:01:04,680 --> 00:01:05,599
How about

8
00:01:08,319 --> 00:01:09,519
we try another way?

9
00:01:09,719 --> 00:01:10,920
I'm fine.

10
00:01:12,359 --> 00:01:13,560
Don't worry about me.

11
00:01:15,799 --> 00:01:17,000
It's just that scumbag

12
00:01:17,000 --> 00:01:18,640
grabbed me and kissed me
a couple of times.

13
00:01:19,439 --> 00:01:20,640
It's no big deal.

14
00:01:22,359 --> 00:01:23,200
Besides,

15
00:01:23,519 --> 00:01:25,359
he sees me as Zhao Ke now.

16
00:01:25,840 --> 00:01:27,920
I should be happy, shouldn't I?

17
00:01:31,519 --> 00:01:32,719
You should be happy too.

18
00:01:34,120 --> 00:01:34,920
Jiang Lai.

19
00:01:37,519 --> 00:01:39,879
When did you become so overprotective?

20
00:01:41,959 --> 00:01:43,159
Like you asked,

21
00:01:44,560 --> 00:01:45,719
I took the photos.

22
00:01:47,319 --> 00:01:48,480
But I want to destroy them.

23
00:01:49,519 --> 00:01:50,719
We'll find another way.

24
00:02:04,799 --> 00:02:06,719
I sent them to Su Qinglan.

25
00:02:08,000 --> 00:02:10,639
Makes the game more interesting,
doesn't it?

26
00:02:19,840 --> 00:02:21,439
Haotian is in North America right now.

27
00:02:21,759 --> 00:02:24,400
These photos were clearly taken here
in China.

28
00:02:24,639 --> 00:02:26,319
Someone is obviously trying
to frame him.

29
00:02:26,919 --> 00:02:28,680
It must be someone competing with him.

30
00:02:28,960 --> 00:02:32,599
Haotian would never betray me.

31
00:02:36,120 --> 00:02:36,840
Mr. Li.

32
00:02:37,439 --> 00:02:38,280
Ms. Su.

33
00:02:41,120 --> 00:02:43,319
Lulu is just too innocent.

34
00:02:43,520 --> 00:02:45,240
She won't listen no matter what I say.

35
00:02:45,479 --> 00:02:46,599
What about the kidney donor?

36
00:02:46,719 --> 00:02:47,800
How is the investigation going?

37
00:02:47,960 --> 00:02:48,800
Ms. Su,

38
00:02:48,960 --> 00:02:50,840
we've obtained all the hospital records.

39
00:02:51,520 --> 00:02:53,199
The donor's name was Jiang Lai.

40
00:02:53,840 --> 00:02:54,879
The records state

41
00:02:54,879 --> 00:02:56,680
that it was a voluntary,
unpaid donation.

42
00:02:56,879 --> 00:02:58,319
There was no sign of coercion
or any transaction.

43
00:02:59,840 --> 00:03:01,840
(Zhang Haotian is a nobody.)

44
00:03:02,400 --> 00:03:03,800
(He has no connections or background.)

45
00:03:03,879 --> 00:03:05,279
(How could he have found)

46
00:03:05,280 --> 00:03:06,400
(a matching kidney so quickly?)

47
00:03:07,319 --> 00:03:08,800
(This is definitely not a coincidence.)

48
00:03:09,479 --> 00:03:10,960
(I won't let Lulu)

49
00:03:11,400 --> 00:03:13,080
(fall into the hands of someone
like him.)

50
00:03:35,400 --> 00:03:37,199
You've been keeping an eye
on Zhao Ke lately.

51
00:03:37,520 --> 00:03:39,319
You probably haven't had much time
for Lin Lulu.

52
00:03:50,120 --> 00:03:51,439
I told her there was urgent work

53
00:03:51,439 --> 00:03:52,919
to handle in North America.

54
00:03:53,520 --> 00:03:54,599
I won't be back for a month.

55
00:03:55,199 --> 00:03:56,479
Aren't you afraid this will blow up
in your face?

56
00:03:59,120 --> 00:04:01,319
You and Lin Lulu have
a prenuptial agreement.

57
00:04:01,800 --> 00:04:02,960
I'm just saying, what if...

58
00:04:03,120 --> 00:04:04,479
what if she kicks you out?

59
00:04:04,479 --> 00:04:06,560
Then all our efforts will have been
for nothing.

60
00:04:06,759 --> 00:04:07,800
You're worrying too much.

61
00:04:08,960 --> 00:04:10,759
I'm flying back from North America
today.

62
00:04:11,639 --> 00:04:12,800
I'll give her a surprise.

63
00:04:14,479 --> 00:04:15,599
The longer we wait,
the more risks we take.

64
00:04:16,319 --> 00:04:17,759
We should get her to steal
the prenuptial agreement

65
00:04:17,759 --> 00:04:19,279
from Su Qinglan as soon as possible.

66
00:04:20,360 --> 00:04:21,319
Got it.

67
00:04:23,120 --> 00:04:24,279
Do you still have enough money?

68
00:04:24,279 --> 00:04:25,519
Do you need me to...

69
00:04:29,319 --> 00:04:31,279
Being Lin Lulu's husband

70
00:04:31,600 --> 00:04:33,560
makes it easy for me
to secure investments.

71
00:04:33,839 --> 00:04:36,879
Once I have the funds, I can keep
the investors I lured in before.

72
00:04:37,040 --> 00:04:39,160
Those investors will come back
and invest even more.

73
00:04:39,199 --> 00:04:40,759
For this 20-million-yuan project,

74
00:04:40,759 --> 00:04:41,959
I'll put in 10 million first.

75
00:04:41,959 --> 00:04:42,920
I'll put in the remaining 10 million

76
00:04:42,920 --> 00:04:44,720
once the project is about to launch.

77
00:04:44,759 --> 00:04:46,759
Sure. Then stay with me
for two more days.

78
00:04:52,160 --> 00:04:52,959
Mr. Zhang.

79
00:04:53,839 --> 00:04:55,399
Perhaps we should discuss this again.

80
00:04:55,680 --> 00:04:57,680
When you turned me down, Ms. Shen,
I already made myself clear.

81
00:04:58,240 --> 00:04:59,120
The offer won't be on the table forever.

82
00:04:59,519 --> 00:05:02,000
I know you have
the Lin family's backing.

83
00:05:02,000 --> 00:05:04,000
What if I add another ten million?

84
00:05:05,360 --> 00:05:05,959
(I love you, Lin Lulu!)
Baby.

85
00:05:06,319 --> 00:05:08,040
(Zhang Haotian❤Lin Lulu)
I bought you

86
00:05:08,040 --> 00:05:08,920
that Ferrari you wanted.

87
00:05:09,360 --> 00:05:10,079
Honey.

88
00:05:10,120 --> 00:05:10,720
Yeah?

89
00:05:10,720 --> 00:05:11,560
I love you so much.

90
00:05:12,959 --> 00:05:13,639
Don't worry.

91
00:05:15,120 --> 00:05:16,360
There won't be any problems.

92
00:05:19,120 --> 00:05:22,000
(The prenuptial agreement has to go.)

93
00:05:27,160 --> 00:05:29,560
Honey, when are you coming home?

94
00:05:29,560 --> 00:05:30,879
I miss you so much.

95
00:05:30,879 --> 00:05:33,360
Baby, it'll still be a while
before I can come back.

96
00:05:33,959 --> 00:05:34,959
Where are you?

97
00:05:36,480 --> 00:05:37,600
Honey.

98
00:05:37,600 --> 00:05:38,240
Baby.

99
00:05:38,240 --> 00:05:39,240
I miss you like crazy.

100
00:05:39,759 --> 00:05:41,680
Did you bring me a gift?

101
00:05:41,680 --> 00:05:42,480
Guess.

102
00:05:48,000 --> 00:05:48,960
(Condom)

103
00:05:50,639 --> 00:05:51,439
What does this mean?

104
00:05:56,120 --> 00:05:57,439
This is your gift.

105
00:05:57,680 --> 00:05:59,240
You think I need this as a gift?

106
00:05:59,839 --> 00:06:02,439
I want to have a baby with you now.

107
00:06:03,360 --> 00:06:04,560
You don't want a child with me?

108
00:06:04,639 --> 00:06:06,240
Say something, Zhang Haotian.

109
00:06:06,240 --> 00:06:07,040
Say it!

110
00:06:07,040 --> 00:06:08,040
I don't want our child

111
00:06:08,040 --> 00:06:10,360
to grow up in a family
where the father isn't accepted.

112
00:06:10,560 --> 00:06:11,759
That's not real love.

113
00:06:11,759 --> 00:06:12,680
And it's not a real family.

114
00:06:12,680 --> 00:06:13,759
It wouldn't be fair to the child.

115
00:06:14,439 --> 00:06:16,319
A father who isn't accepted?

116
00:06:18,279 --> 00:06:19,319
I knew it.

117
00:06:19,759 --> 00:06:21,160
The prenuptial agreement
my mom made you sign...

118
00:06:21,160 --> 00:06:22,680
I knew it would make you overthink.

119
00:06:22,920 --> 00:06:24,680
Your mother only did it
for your own good.

120
00:06:24,680 --> 00:06:25,759
For my own good?

121
00:06:26,079 --> 00:06:27,279
If she really cared about me,

122
00:06:27,279 --> 00:06:28,759
we would've gotten married a year ago.

123
00:06:28,759 --> 00:06:30,040
Why wait until now?

124
00:06:30,560 --> 00:06:31,839
You signed it, fine.

125
00:06:31,959 --> 00:06:33,319
But she even locked the agreement away.

126
00:06:33,319 --> 00:06:34,319
Who is she trying to protect it from?

127
00:06:42,879 --> 00:06:43,920
Is this for me?

128
00:06:43,920 --> 00:06:44,680
Do you like it?

129
00:06:44,879 --> 00:06:46,040
I love it.

130
00:06:47,120 --> 00:06:48,160
You're the best.

131
00:06:49,959 --> 00:06:51,560
(I can't just sit here and wait.)

132
00:06:51,639 --> 00:06:54,160
(I need to do something else
to speed things up.)

133
00:06:56,400 --> 00:06:58,360
(Driving a Wedge)

134
00:06:58,992 --> 00:07:03,890
♪Listen, the wind chimes softly whisper♪

135
00:07:04,176 --> 00:07:07,590
♪I should forget you♪

136
00:07:07,672 --> 00:07:12,520
♪But I have the will,
yet not the strength♪

137
00:07:12,600 --> 00:07:14,664
♪To carry on♪

138
00:07:14,720 --> 00:07:20,152
♪The scenery you once longed to see♪

139
00:07:20,216 --> 00:07:22,630
♪You no longer have the strength♪

140
00:07:24,340 --> 00:07:27,160
♪You want me to go there for you♪

141
00:07:28,860 --> 00:07:34,120
♪I look up and see a hollow sky♪

142
00:07:34,872 --> 00:07:38,120
♪Your freedom♪

143
00:07:38,360 --> 00:07:43,190
♪Has become my cage♪

144
00:07:43,980 --> 00:07:50,712
♪My hand brushes over your smile
in the photograph♪

145
00:07:51,260 --> 00:07:56,264
♪This glass of wine is filled
with sorrow♪

146
00:07:57,420 --> 00:08:03,144
♪I look up at the beautiful night sky♪

147
00:08:03,780 --> 00:08:06,621
♪You told me♪

148
00:08:06,622 --> 00:08:11,600
♪I would shine like a star♪

149
00:08:12,600 --> 00:08:16,528
♪But you forgot to teach me♪

150
00:08:16,529 --> 00:08:20,360
♪How to live without you♪

151
00:08:21,030 --> 00:08:26,776
♪I look up at the starry sky♪

152
00:08:28,184 --> 00:08:31,280
♪So hazy and blurred♪
